message: "If you reference these tools or projects, please cite this repository."
title: "Vino - CG Generalist and Technical Artist: profile and project index"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Vino
    alias: vino3dx
    website: "https://vinofx.com/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vino3dx/vino3dx"
url: "https://vinofx.com/"
abstract: >-
  Vino is a CG Generalist and Technical Artist working on real-time graphics,
  game engine tooling, shaders, VFX, DCC automation and AI-assisted development
  workflows. This repository indexes verified public projects, including MCP
  servers for Autodesk 3ds Max and Godot, automation toolkits for 3ds Max and
  Blender, Godot utility and licensing tools, and offline computer vision
  components for game engines.
keywords:
